        "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0008:0001",
        "ko": "This class is a subclass of [`URLSessionTask`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Foundation/URLSessionTask) that you use to download HTTP Live Streaming assets."
      },
      {
        "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0008:0002",
